  "source": "Smart X835 Smart Meter Modbus Protocol (Elektramat copy of the manufacturer's protocol document)",
  "notes": [
    "Smartprocess Smartrail X835.",
    "Measured values are input registers read with function 04, two registers per value, at the addresses in the manual (30001 = address 0). At most 40 parameters per request.",
    "The protocol document does not state the number format. The table follows the Eastron SDM family layout, so the values are read as IEEE 754 float32, high word first.",
    "Energy values are in kWh (or MWh) according to the Energy units prefix setting; ampere hours are in Ah (or kAh).",
    "Not tested on a device."
  ],
